            </note>
            <note corresp="#d864-f2" n="2" xml:id="d864-f2-content">
                <p>The press release along the above lines was issued in Tokyo on December 22
                    (Telegram ZX–16940, December 22, from Tokyo; Black Book, Tab 131).</p>
            </note>
